 the following','short_answer','Do kittens come out of eggs?',1,0,NULL,NULL,'No, kittens are born from the mother’s tummy.',1,NULL,NULL),(2356,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',12,'','Answer the following','short_answer','What are the similarities between the hen and her chick?',2,0,NULL,NULL,'Both are birds, share the same species, and the chick grows inside the hen’s egg.',1,NULL,NULL),(2357,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',15,'','Answer the following','short_answer','When the growth of the caterpillar is complete, it enters the pupa stage.',3,0,NULL,NULL,'True',1,NULL,NULL),(2358,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',16,'','Answer the following','mcq','When you shell peas, you sometimes see tiny green living things inside the pod. Which of the four stages of the life cycle of an insect are they?',4,0,NULL,'[\"Egg\",\"Larva\",\"Pupa\",\"Adult\"]','1',1,NULL,NULL),(2359,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',16,'','Answer the following','reason','Why must the hen sit on her eggs?',5,0,NULL,NULL,'To keep the eggs warm and protect them from predators.',1,NULL,NULL),(2360,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',16,'','Answer the following','reason','Why does a hen become aggressive when she is hatching her eggs?',6,0,NULL,NULL,'Because she wants to protect her eggs from being disturbed.',1,NULL,NULL),(2361,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',16,'','Answer the following','define','Which are the four stages of the life cycle of a butterfly?',7,0,NULL,NULL,'Egg, larva (caterpillar), pupa (chrysalis), adult.',1,NULL,NULL),(2362,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',16,'','Answer the following','short_answer','Which changes take place inside the chrysalis of the Plain Tiger butterfly?',8,0,NULL,NULL,'The caterpillar transforms into an adult butterfly inside the chrysalis.',1,NULL,NULL),(2363,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',16,'','Answer the following','short_answer','Alamb emerges from an egg.',9,0,NULL,NULL,'True',1,NULL,NULL),(2364,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',16,'','Answer the following','short_answer','We cannot easily see the eggs of an ant because they are very tiny.',10,0,NULL,NULL,'True',1,NULL,NULL),(2365,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',16,'','Answer the following','short_answer','When the caterpillar emerges from the egg, it is not very hungry.',11,0,NULL,NULL,'False',1,NULL,NULL),(2366,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',16,'','Answer the following','short_answer','The female butterfly lays on the leaves of a plant.',12,0,NULL,NULL,'True',1,NULL,NULL),(2367,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',16,'','Answer the following','fill_blank','The larva of a butterfly is called ______.',13,0,NULL,NULL,'caterpillar',1,NULL,NULL),(2368,15,16562,4,'EVS Part 1','en',16,'','Draw and colour the picture of a Plain Tiger butterfly','draw','Draw and colour the picture of a Plain Tiger butterfly',14,1,'15/015.jpg',NULL,NULL,1,'15/015_6.jpg',NULL),(2369,15,16563,4,'EVS Part 1','en',19,'','Answer the following','one_sentence','From where do we get silk?',1,0,NULL,NULL,'Silk is obtained from the cocoons of silkworms (Bombyx mori).',1,NULL,NULL),(2370,15,16563,4,'EVS Part 1','en',19,'','Answer the following','one_sentence','How are trees useful for monkeys?',2,0,NULL,NULL,'Trees provide food, shelter, and a place to move and play for monkeys.',1,NULL,NULL),(2371,15,16563,4,'EVS Part 1','en',19,'','Answer the following','one_sentence','How are trees useful for birds?',3,0,NULL,NULL,'Trees offer nesting sites, food sources like fruits and insects, and protection from predators for birds.',1,NULL,NULL),(2372,15,16563,4,'EVS Part 1','en',19,'','Answer the following','one_sentence','What happens if termites make a tree hollow?',4,0,NULL,NULL,'The tree becomes weaker and may fall, and the hollow can be used by other animals for shelter.',1,NULL,NULL),(2373,15,16563,4,'EVS Part 1','en',22,'','Answer the following','fill_blank','The Marathi name for mango blossoms is ______ and mango trees blossom every year in ______.',5,0,NULL,'[\"mohur\",\"January\"]','mohur, January',1,NULL,NULL),(2374,15,16563,4,'EVS Part 1','en',22,'','A