ay?\",\"The Boys fixed Teddy’s broken arm and kept it back on the bench.\"]]'),(3453,19,16662,4,'English','en',38,'','Read and number these sentences correctly in the boxes to sequence the story','solve','Read and number these sentences correctly in the boxes to sequence the story',6,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(3456,19,16663,4,'English','en',40,'','For the Teacher','descriptive','Observe the picture and number the sequence of jaggery making process in the circles given',1,1,'19/039.jpg',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(3457,19,16663,4,'English','en',40,'','For the Teacher','descriptive','Arrange a visit to sugar factory or Gurhal of learners',2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(3458,19,16663,4,'English','en',40,'','For the Teacher','descriptive','Encourage them to write the process of making of sugar and jaggery',3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(3459,19,16664,4,'English','en',41,'','Answer the following','short_answer','Describe why saying ‘Thank you’ is important.',1,0,NULL,NULL,'It shows appreciation and makes people feel valued.',1,NULL,NULL),(3460,19,16664,4,'English','en',43,'','Match the sentence with the correct picture','match','Match the sentence with the correct picture',2,1,'19/042.jpg','[\"May I go out? | small\",\"May I help you? | better\",\"May I borrow your toy? | kind\",\"May I drink water? | joy\",\"I am sorry | small\"]','May I go out? | small',1,NULL,NULL),(3461,19,16664,4,'English','en',43,'','Create a short poem using the words: Thank you, Sorry, Welcome','one_sentence','Create a short poem using the words: Thank you, Sorry, Welcome',3,0,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for the smile, Sorry for the slip, Welcome to the fun!',1,NULL,NULL),(3464,19,16665,4,'English','en',45,'','Let’s find out from the passage.','fill_blank','A panda can eat up to ______ to ______ kilograms of bamboo everyday.',1,0,NULL,NULL,'12–38',1,NULL,NULL),(3465,19,16665,4,'English','en',45,'','Let’s find out from the passage.','fill_blank','A panda is a ______ and ______ animal.',2,0,NULL,NULL,