e benefits of solar energy and how to increase usage of it',24,0,NULL,NULL,'Solar energy is clean, renewable and free. Its benefits include reducing electricity bills, lowering pollution and providing power in remote areas. Usage can be increased by installing solar panels on roofs, using solar cookers and promoting solar projects.',1,NULL,NULL),(8632,36,17009,6,'Science','en',136,'','लघु उत्तर','short_answer','Explain in short about types of marine resources and their uses for humans',25,0,NULL,NULL,'Marine resources include fish, shellfish, seaweed, minerals from the sea floor and marine plants. They are used for food, medicine, cosmetics, construction materials and as sources of minerals like copper and iron.',1,NULL,NULL),(8633,36,17009,6,'Science','en',136,'','लघु उत्तर','short_answer','Which type of energy will be beneficial for us in future? renewable or non‑renewable, why?',26,0,NULL,NULL,'Renewable energy will be beneficial because it is abundant, clean and does not deplete finite resources.',1,NULL,NULL),(8634,36,17009,6,'Science','en',136,'','कारण द्या','reason','What should be done to protect and take care of the trees and shrubs in the surroundings?',27,0,NULL,NULL,'Plant more trees, avoid cutting, protect saplings, use mulch, conserve forest areas and promote community awareness.',1,NULL,NULL),(8635,36,17009,6,'Science','en',136,'','कारण द्या','reason','If fossil fuels are exhausted, what effects will it have on our daily life? List all the possible effects, you can think of.',28,0,NULL,NULL,'Higher fuel prices, loss of electricity, increased use of alternative energy, job losses in fossil fuel industries, higher pollution from substitutes, changes in transportation and heating.',1,NULL,NULL),(8636,36,17009,6,'Science','en',136,'','कारण द्या','reason','Small solar panels are available for science projects. Using them, make some toys and equipments',29,0,NULL,NULL,'Use small solar panels to power small devices like fans, lights, or toy cars, demonstrating renewable energy.',1,NULL,NULL),(8637,36,17009,6,'Science','en',136,'','कारण द्या','reason','Collect information about ‘Medicinal plants and their use’ in your surroundings',30,0,NULL,NULL,'Research local plants like neem, tulsi, aloe vera, gather data on their medicinal properties and uses in traditional medicine.',1,NULL,NULL),(8638,36,17009,6,'Science','en',136,'','कारण द्या','reason','Make three groups of friends from your class. Name each group separately Diet group — Collect information about food obtained from sea Mineral group — Collect information about different minerals from sea Medicine group — Collect information about useful materials, used in medicine production obtained from sea Each group will present the information collected in the class',31,0,NULL,NULL,'Organise groups, assign tasks, gather data, prepare presentations and share findings with classmates.',1,NULL,NULL),(8639,36,17009,6,'Science','en',136,'','कारण द्या','reason','Make some decorative and useful articles from clay',32,0,NULL,NULL,'Shape clay into pots, figurines, tiles or toys, then dry and fire them to create durable items.',1,NULL,NULL),(8640,36,17009,6,'Science','en',136,'','कारण द्या','reason','We can collect different seeds from our home and neighbours. Seeds collected like this are kept in the mud ball and such dried ball is called seed ball. Make such seed balls with your friends. During rainy season, throw these seed balls around your school premises and in your neighborhood to help create a forest.',33,0,NULL,NULL,'Collect seeds, mix with clay, form balls, dry them, then distribute them during rains to encourage tree growth.',1,NULL,NULL),(8641,37,17010,6,'Science','mr',26,'','रिकाम्या जागा भरा','fill_blank','दोन बिंदूंमधील अंतर मोजताना पहिल्या बिंदूवर मापनपट्टीचा आरंभबिंदू ठेवावा. दुसरा बिंदू पट्टीच्या ______',1,0,NULL,NULL,'खुणेवर',1,NULL,NULL),(8642,37,17010,6,'Science','mr',30,'','सोप्या पद्धतीने स्पष्ट करा','descriptive','साबणाने व पाण्याने हात स्वच्छ करा',2,0,NULL,N