केचे उत्पन्न स्रोत म्हणजे कर (जमीन कर, मालमत्ता कर, सेवा कर), शुल्क, अनुदान, सार्वजनिक-खासगी भागीदारी आणि इतर सार्वजनिक उत्पन्न.',1,NULL,NULL),(9465,40,17053,6,'History & Civics','mr',99,'','खालील प्रश्‍नांची थोडक्यात उत्तरे लिहा','short_answer','जिल्हा महसूल प्रशासनाची कार्ये काय आहेत?',10,0,NULL,NULL,'जिल्हा महसूल प्रशासनाची कार्ये म्हणजे जमीन नोंदणी, कर वसुली, मालमत्ता मूल्यांकन, जमीन व मालमत्ता नोंदणी, आणि जमीन व मालमत्ता संबंधित कायदेशीर बाबींचे व्यवस्थापन.',1,NULL,NULL),(9514,41,17054,7,'English','en',12,'','Sing the song','activity','Sing the song \"It’s a Small World\"',1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(9515,41,17054,7,'English','en',12,'','Note down pairs of rhyming words from the poem','activity','Note down pairs of rhyming words from the poem and add one more rhyming word to each pair',2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(9516,41,17054,7,'English','en',12,'','Guess and discuss the meaning of the following lines','activity','Guess and discuss the meaning of the following lines:\n• It’s a world of laughter\n• A world of tears\n• It’s a world of hopes\n• And a world of fears',3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(9521,41,17054,7,'English','en',12,'','Give examples of gestures','activity','The poem says ‘And a smile means friendship to everyone’. Give examples of other actions or gestures that mean the same in all parts of the world. Give three examples of gestures or actions that have a specific meaning only in certain regions. One such example would be the ‘Thumbs up’ sign.',4,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(9522,41,17054,7,'English','en',12,'','Prepare simple conversations','activity','The following sentences were heard in a school on the first day. Use these expressions to prepare simple conversations between two or more speakers. You may use the same expressions more than once, and add your own lines. Form pairs or groups and present the conversations in the classroom.\n• Hello!\n• Hi!\n• So nice to see you again.\n• I’m ........ .\n• I am so glad to see you all!\n