ducation, health care, and nutrition for children.',1,NULL,NULL),(15750,59,17361,8,'Geography','en',57,'','Answer the following','solve','Find the reason behind the migrant population of more than 20% in the given countries.',11,0,NULL,NULL,'Reasons may include better job opportunities, higher wages, and better living conditions in the destination country.',1,NULL,NULL),(15751,59,17361,8,'Geography','en',57,'','Answer the following','draw','Draw two pie diagrams for any two countries showing the proportion of literate and illiterate people.',12,1,'59/056.jpg',NULL,NULL,1,'59/056_2.jpg',NULL),(15753,59,17361,8,'Geography','en',57,'','Answer the following','activity','Have a discussion on migration and development.',13,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(15754,59,17361,8,'Geography','en',59,'','Answer the following','one_word','Name the sparsely populated districts with density less than 100 per sq. km in the eastern districts of Maharashtra.',14,0,NULL,NULL,'Gadchiroli, Gondia, and Amravati.',1,NULL,NULL),(15755,59,17361,8,'Geography','en',59,'','Answer the following','descriptive','What is the density of the dark shaded industrialised area in Maharashtra?',15,0,NULL,NULL,'The density is high, typically above 1,000 people per sq. km, indicating a highly urbanised area.',1,NULL,NULL),(15756,59,17361,8,'Geography','en',59,'','Answer the following','reason','Why is the density of population less in Pune and Nagpur districts, which have higher industrialisation?',16,0,NULL,NULL,'These districts have large forested or hilly areas, limiting habitation, and many industrial sites are located in less populated zones.',1,NULL,NULL),(15757,59,17361,8,'Geography','en',59,'','Answer the following','activity','Have a discussion in the class on the effect of districts in the extreme east which are densely forested on the density of population.',17,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(15758,59,17361,8,'Geography','en',61,'','Answer the following','fill_blank','If the birth rate is greater than