reached the West coast of India at Calicut port.',7,0,NULL,'[\"Siraj-ud-Daulah\",\"Mir Kasim\",\"Mir Jafar\",\"Shah Alam\"]','3',1,NULL,NULL),(16114,61,17375,8,'History & Civics','en',19,'','Explain the following concept','explain','Colonialism',8,0,NULL,NULL,'Colonialism is the domination of one country over another for political and economic gain, often involving military control and exploitation of resources.',1,NULL,NULL),(16115,61,17375,8,'History & Civics','en',19,'','Explain the following concept','explain','Imperialism',9,1,'61/018.jpg',NULL,'Imperialism is the policy of extending a nation’s power through colonies, trade, or influence, often to secure economic advantage.',1,'61/018_2.jpg',NULL),(16116,61,17375,8,'History & Civics','en',19,'','Explain the following concept','explain','Age of Renaissance',10,0,NULL,NULL,'The Renaissance was a cultural revival of classical Greek and Roman ideas, leading to advances in art, science and humanism.',1,NULL,NULL),(16117,61,17375,8,'History & Civics','en',19,'','Explain the following concept','explain','Capitalism',11,0,NULL,NULL,'Capitalism is an economic system where private owners control production and profit from trade, driven by competition and market forces.',1,NULL,NULL),(16118,61,17375,8,'History & Civics','en',19,'','Explain the following concept','explain','Work of famous painters, writers, scientists',12,0,NULL,NULL,'Famous artists like Leonardo da Vinci, writers like Shakespeare, and scientists like Copernicus contributed to the Renaissance and Enlightenment.',1,NULL,NULL),(16119,61,17375,8,'History & Civics','en',19,'','Explain the following statement','explain','Siraj-ud-Daulah was defeated in the Battle of Plassey.',13,0,NULL,NULL,'Siraj-ud-Daulah lost the Battle of Plassey in 1757, which gave the British East India Company control over Bengal.',1,NULL,NULL),(16121,61,17376,8,'History & Civics','en',24,'','Fill in the blank','fill_blank','In 1802 Peshwa ______ signed the Subsidiary Alliance with the B