ey more than their target = 2657340 – 2500000 = 157340','',0,0,0,NULL),(9780,115,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Use the number 23849 and 27056 to make a subtraction problem solve the problem.','','','Ramesh wants to buy washing machine to shop, printed price of machine is Rs. 27056. He has Rs. 23849 then find how much money less by buying washing machine?\nNeed money to buying washing machine = 27056 – 23849 = Rs. 3207\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(9781,115,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Solve: i) 89329 – 86987 + 1485 		ii) 8428832 – 1488783 ','','','i) 3827		ii) 6940049','',0,0,0,NULL),(9782,115,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','A company produced 33890 scooters in a certain year and 89983 in the next. How many more scooters did they produce in the previous year?','','','Company produced scooters more by previous year \n= 89983 – 33890 = 56093\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(9783,115,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','A village includes 28932 students in the college, in that 23242 are boys, how many girls are there?','','','Total number of girls in village = 28932 – 23242 = 5690','',0,0,0,NULL),(9784,115,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Solve: i) 32484 – 14326 		ii) 87509 – 18969 ','','','i) 18158		ii) 68540','',0,0,0,NULL),(9785,115,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Solve: i) 43207 – 18987 		ii) 40507 – 18939 ','','','i) 24220		ii) 21568','',0,0,0,NULL),(9786,115,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Solve: i) 832483 – 284328 		ii) 387875 – 198326 ','','','i) 548155		ii) 189549','',0,0,0,NULL),(9787,115,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Solve: i) 832005 – 324326 		ii) 389932 – 132897 ','','','i) 507679             	ii) 257035','',0,0,0,NULL),(9788,115,'descriptive','4',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','If Surekhatai bought a tractor for Rs. 807957 and a thresher for Rs. 32609 how much money did she spend altogether.','','','Surekhatai total spend money = 807957 + 32609 = Rs. 840566','',0,0,0,NULL),(9789,11