scriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','In a plantation, saplings of 215 medicinal trees have been planted in each of the 132 rows of trees. How many sapling are there in the plantation together?','','','Total number of sapling of trees = 215 × 132 = 28380 ','',0,0,0,NULL),(9859,116,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','One computer costs 27540 rupees. How much will 18 such computers cost?','','','Cost of 18 computers = 27540 × 18 = Rs. 495720','',0,0,0,NULL),(9860,116,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','If a certain two-wheeler costs 53670 rupees. How much will 35 such two wheelers?','','','The cost of 35 two wheelers = 53670 × 35 = 1878450','',0,0,0,NULL),(9861,116,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','One traveler incurs a cost of 7650 rupees for a certain journey. What will be the cost for 26 such traveler? ','','','The cost of 26 traveler  = 7650 × 26 = 198900','',0,0,0,NULL),(9862,116,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Divide: 56741 ÷ 26','','','2182.34','',0,0,0,NULL),(9863,116,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','How many hours will it take travel 336 km at a speed of 48 km per hour?','','','Total time taken = 336/48 = 7 hours','',0,0,0,NULL),(9864,116,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','The cost of one bag is 1750 rupees, what is the cost of such 56 bags?','','','Total cost of 56 bags = 1750 × 56 = Rs. 98000','',0,0,0,NULL),(9865,116,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','The cost of one bicycle is 4500 rupees, what is the cost of such 16 bicycles?','','','Total cost of 16 bicycles = 4500 × 16 = Rs. 72000','',0,0,0,NULL),(9866,116,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Write multiplication for the 8985 and 324 numbers.','','','8985 × 324 = 2911140','',0,0,0,NULL),(9867,116,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Divide: 8546 ÷ 13','','','657.38','',0,0,0,NULL),(9868,116,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Divide: 3269 ÷ 35','','','93.4','',0,0,0,NULL),(9869,116,'descriptive','2',2