n)² \n            = (2p)² + (3m)² + (4n)² + 2 × 2p × 3m + 2 × 3m × 4n + 2 × 2p × 4n\n            = 8p² + 9m² + 16n² + 12pm + 24mn + 16pn','',0,0,0,NULL),(12779,76,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','The product of (x + a) and ( x + b)= \na) x² - (a – b) x + ab 		b) x² + (a + b) x + ab         c) x² + (a – b) x – ab 		d) x² - (a + b) x + ab','','','b) x² + (a + b) x + ab','',0,0,0,NULL),(12780,76,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','The expansion (m – 1/m)² = -------\na) m² + 2 – 1/m² 	   b) m² - 2 – 1/m² 	     c) m² + 2 + 1/m²  	        d) m² - 2 + 1/m²','','','d) m² - 2 + 1/m²','',0,0,0,NULL),(12781,76,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','The numerical coefficient of -21xy² is -------\na) -21x 		b) -21 	     c) -21y² 		d) -xy²','','','b) -21 ','',0,0,0,NULL),(12782,76,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','The common factor of 64x²y and 36y is -------\na) 8y 		b) 4y 		c) 9x 			d) 4x','','','b) 4y 	','',0,0,0,NULL),(12783,76,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','The quotient obtained on dividing x² - 4 by x + 2 is ----\na) x + 2 		b) x – 2 	        c) – x + 2	          	d) none of these','','','b) x – 2 ','',0,0,0,NULL),(12785,76,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factors of a³ - 8b³ are --------\na) (a + 2b) (a² + 2ab + (2b)²) 	        b) (a – 2b) (a² + 2ab + (2b)²)        c) (a – 2b) (a² - ab + b²) 		d) (a + 2b) (a² - ab + b²)\n','','','c) (a – 2b) (a² - ab + b²) ','',0,0,0,NULL),(12786,76,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factors of  (x³ - x²) are ------\na) x(x² - 1)        	b) x³ (x – 1) 		       c) x² (x – 1) 		d) x (x – 1)\n','','','b) x³ (x – 1) 	','',0,0,0,NULL),(12787,76,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','The factors of x² + xy + yz + zx = -------\na) (x + y)(y + z) 		b) (x + z)(x + y)         c) (x - y) (y + z)		d) (x + y)( x- z)','','','b) (x + z)(x + y) ','',0,0,0,NULL),(12788,76,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','The factors of 8x³ - 27y³ and (2x – 3y) are -------\na) 4x² + 6xy + 9y² 			b) 4x² - 6xy + 9y²	     c) 4x² - 6xy – 9y²			d) 4x