 (m² - 1/m²) 	b) (m – 1/m) (m² - 1 + 1/m²)           c) (m – 1/m) (m² + 1 + 1/m²)  	d) (m – 1/m) (m² + 1 – 1/m²)\n','','','c) (m – 1/m) (m² + 1 + 1/m²) ','',0,0,0,NULL),(12798,76,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','If A and B are algebraic expressions then A/B is called a ---- expression\na) rational         	b) algebraic 	         c) rational algebraic 	         d) algebraic ratios\n','','','c) rational algebraic ','',0,0,0,NULL),(12799,76,'descriptive','1b',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','Fill in the blanks: x³ - 216y³ = ⎕ (x² + 6xy + 36y²)','','','x³ - 216y³ = (x – 6y)(x² + 6xy + 36y²)','',0,0,0,NULL),(12800,76,'descriptive','2',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise : x³ + 64y³','','','x³ + 64y³ = x³ + (4y)³ = (x + 4y)(x² - 4xy + 16y²)','',0,0,0,NULL),(12801,76,'descriptive','2',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise:  125p³ + q³','','','125p³ + q³ = (5p)³ + q³ = (5p + q)(25p² - 5pq + q²)','',0,0,0,NULL),(12802,76,'descriptive','2',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise :  125k³ + 27m³','','','125k³ + 27m³ = (5k)³ + (3m)³ = (5k + 3m)(25k² - 15km + 9m²)','',0,0,0,NULL),(12803,76,'descriptive','2',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise :  2t³ + 432m³','','','2t³ + 432m³ = 2[t³ + 216m³] = 2[t³ + (6m)³]\n= 2[(t + 6m)(t – 6mt + 36m²)]\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(12804,76,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise : 24a³ + 81b³','','','24a³ + 81b³ = 3[8a³ + 27b³] = 3[(2a)³ + (3b)³]\n= 3[(2a + 3b)(4a² - 6ab + 9b²)]\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(12805,76,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise :  y³ - 27  ','','','y³ - 27 = y³ - 3³ = (y – 3)(y² + 3y + 9)','',0,0,0,NULL),(12806,76,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise : x³ - 64y³','','','x³ - 64y³ = x³ - (4y)³ = (x – 4y)(x + 4xy + 16y²)','',0,0,0,NULL),(12807,76,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise :  37m³ - 216n³','','','27m³ - 216n³ = (3m)³ - (6n)³\n= (3m – 6n)(9m² + 18mn + 36n²)\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(12808,76,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise :  125y³ - 1 ','','','125y³ - 1 = (5y)³ - 1³ = (5y – 1)(25y² + 5y + 1)','',0,0,0,NULL),(12809,76,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise : y³ + 1/8y³','','','','',0,0,1,NULL),(12810,76,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise : a³ + 8/a³','','','','',0,0,1,NULL),(12811,76,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise :  1+ q³/125','','','','',0,0,1,NULL),(12813,76,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise:  343a³ - 512b³','','','343a³ - 512b³ = (7a)³ - (8b)³\n= (7a – 8b)(49a² + 56ab + 64b²)\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(12814,76,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise:  64x³ -729y³','','','64x³ -729y³ = (4x)³ - (9y)³\n= (4x – 9y)(16x² + 36xy + 81y²)\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(12815,76,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Factorise: 16a³ - 128/b³','','','','',0,0,1,NULL),(12816,76,'descriptive','4',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Simplify:  (x + y)³ - (x – y)³','','','(x + y)³ - (x – y)³\n= x³ + 3x²y + 3xy² + y³ - (x³ - 3x²y + 3xy² - y³)\n= x³ + 3x²y + 3xy² + y³ - x³ + 3x²y - 3xy² + y³ \n= 6x²y + 2y³\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(12817,76,'descriptive','4',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Simplify:  (3a + 5b)³ - (3a – 5b)³','','','(x + y)³ - (x – y)³ = x³ + 3x²y + 3xy² + y³ - x³ + 3x²y - 3xy² + y³ \n                       = 6x²y + 2y³\n∴ (3a + 5b)³ - (3a – 5b)³ = 6(3a)²(5b) + 2(5b)³\n       = 270a²b + 250b³\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(12818,76,'descriptive','4',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Simplify :  (a + b)³ - a³ - b³','','','(a + b)³ - a³ - b³ = a³ + 3a²b + 3ab² + b³ - a³ - b³ = 3a²b + 3ab²','',0,0,0,NULL),(12819,76,'descriptive','4',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Simplify :  p³ - (p + 1)³','','','p³ - [p³ + 3p² + 3p + 1] = p³ - p³ - 3p² - 3p – 1 \n= -3p² - 3p – 1 = -[3p² + 3p + 1]\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(12820,76,'descriptive','4',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Simplify : (3xy – 2ab)³ - (3xy + 2ab)³','','','(x - y)³ - (x + y)³ = x³ - 3x²y + 3xy² - y³ - x³ - 3x²y - 3xy² - y³ \n                       = -6x²y - 2y³\n∴ (3xy – 2ab)³ - (3xy + 2ab)³ = -6(3xy)²(2ab) – 2(2ab)³\n= -108abx²y – 16a³b³','',0,0,0,NULL),(12821,77,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','The area (A) of the circle is proportional to square of its radius (r). The following statement written in mathematical form as ----- \na) A α √r² 	  b) A α r²         	c) A α 1/r² 	           d) A α r','','','a) A α √r²','',0,0,0,NULL),(12822,77,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','If y directly varies as x and y = 40 when x = 16 then the constant of variation is ------\na) 2/3 		     b) 640         	c) 8 		          d) 5/2','','','d) 5/2','',0,0,0,NULL),(12823,77,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','If a α 1/b and a = 6 when b = 20 then equation of variation is -----\na) a = 120b 	         b) a × b = 120	     c)  a/b = 120 	       d) none of these','','','b) a × b = 120','',0,0,0,NULL),(12824,77,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','The number of workers and time taken to finish the work is an example of ----- variation.\na) direct             	b) inverse 	         c) joint 	           d) no','','','b) inverse 	','',0,0,0,NULL),(12825,77,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','y α √x and y = 8 when x = 4, then the value of y is ------ when x = 9.\na)  4√3		b) 4 	         	c) 12 		d) 24','','','c) 12 ','',0,0,0,NULL),(12826,77,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','15 men can finish the work of building a wall in 8 days. If the same job is to be completed in 6 days then the number of men required is -----\na) 20 		b) 25 		c) 30		d) 35 ','','','a) 20','',0,0,0,NULL),(12827,77,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','‘x and y are in direct variation’ this is mathematically written as ----\na) x = ky  	      b) x/y = k	             c) x α y              	d)  x α 1/y','','','c) x α y       ','',0,0,0,NULL),(12828,77,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','‘x varies inversely as y’ equation for this statement is -----\na) x = ky 	             b) xy = k            	  c) x α y	            d)  x α 1/y','','','b) xy = k    ','',0,0,0,NULL),(12829,77,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','‘Volume of a sphere 