ion : ','Quotient = x² - 2x + 4 ; remainder = 0',0,0,1,NULL),(25410,274,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Divide and write the quotient and remainder : (x³ - 2x² + 2x + 1) ÷ (x – 1)','','','Solution : ','Quotient = x² - x + 1 ; remainder = 2',0,0,1,NULL),(25411,274,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Divide and write the quotient and remainder : (4y² - 16) ÷ (2y – 4)','','','Solution : ','Quotient = 2y + 1 ; remainder = 17',0,0,1,NULL),(25412,274,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','Divide and write the quotient and remainder : (a³ - 64) ÷ (a – 4)','','','Solution : ','Quotient = a² + 4a + 16 ; remainder = 0',0,0,1,NULL),(25413,274,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Text Book','','Divide and write the quotient and remainder : (6x⁵ - 4x⁴ + 8x³ + 2x²) ÷ 2x²','','','Solution : ','Quotient = 3x³ - 2x² + 4x + 1 ; remainder = 0',0,0,1,NULL),(25414,274,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Text Book','','Divide and write the quotient and remainder : (25m⁴ - 15m³ + 10m + 8) ÷ 5m³','','','Solution : ','Quotient = 5m – 3 ; remainder = 10m + 8',0,0,1,NULL),(25415,274,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Text Book','','Divide and write the quotient and remainder : (y² + 10y + 24) ÷ (y + 4)','','','Solution : ','Quotient = y + 6 ; remainder = 0',0,0,1,NULL),(25416,274,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Text Book','','Divide and write the quotient and remainder : (p² + 7p – 5) ÷ (p + 3)','','','Solution : ','Quotient = p + 4 ; remainder = -17 ',0,0,1,NULL),(25417,274,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Divide and write the quotient and remainder : (m⁴ - 16m² + 6m – 20) ÷ (m – 4)','','','Solution : ','Quotient = m³ + 4m² + 6 ; remainder = 0',0,0,1,NULL),(25418,274,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Divide and write the quotient and remainder : (6x³ - 17x² + 6x – 7) ÷ (2x – 3)','','','Solution : ','Quotient = 3x² - 4x – 3 ; remainder = -16',0,0,1,NULL),(25419,274,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Divide and write the quotient and remainder : (x⁴ + 3x³ + 8x² + 12x – 7) ÷ (x² + 