--------------------------------','','','','',0,0,0,NULL),(31330,307,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','If Abdul started working on the computer at 11 in the morning and finished his work at 3:30 in the afternoon, how long did he work?','','','Started working 11 in the morning = 11 : 00\nFinished 3 : 30 in the afternoon = 15 : 30\n         Hrs            Min\n           15             30\n -         11              00\n----------------------\n             4             30\ni. e.  4 hrs 30 minutes  ','',0,0,0,NULL),(31331,307,'descriptive','3',3,2,'Out of Text Book','','Amruta travelled by bus for 3 hours 40 minutes and by motorcycle for 1 hour 45 minutes. How long did she spend travelling?','','','Amruta total travelled by bus and by motorcycle is\n       Hrs            Min\n         3                40\n +     1                45\n----------------------\n        4             85\ni. e.  5 hrs 25 minutes ','',0,0,0,NULL),(31332,308,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','If a shopkeeper has 150 kg 500 g of rice and sells 75 kg 750 g, how much rice will be left?','','','Rice will be left :\n          Kg          g\n         149        1000 + 500\n   -      75          750\n       ---------------------------\n          74       750\ni.e. 74 kg 750 gm rice will be left.','',0,0,0,NULL),(31333,308,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','A can of milk has 20 l 450ml of milk. Another can has 18 l 800ml. How much milk is there in the two cans altogether?','','','         lit            ml\n         20          450\n    +   18           800\n        -------------------\n           38         1250\ni.e. 39 lit 250 ml milk in the two can altogether. ','',0,0,0,NULL),(31334,308,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','At a speed of 90 km per hour, what distance will a train cover in two and a half hours?   ','','','Speed of train in 1 hour = 90 km\n∴ Distance covered by train in 2.5 hours = 2.5 × 90 = 225 km \n','',0,0,0,NULL),(31335,308,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Out of Text Book','','If one dress requires 3 m 25 cm of cloth, how much do 4 dresses need?','','','One dress requires 3 m 25 cm of cloth\n∴ 4 dresses requires cloth = 4 × 3.25 = 13 m cloth\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(31336,308,'descriptive','2',2,1,'Out of Text Book','','If a wire that is 9 m 50 cm long is cut into pieces of 5 cm each, how many pieces will be made ?','','','Length of wire = 9 m 50 cm \n∴ Length of wire = 900 + 50 = 950 cm   [100 cm = 1 m]\n∴ No. of pieces having length 5 cm each = 950/5 = 190','',0,0,0,NULL),(31340,375,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','12 मी 3 मिमी दशांश अपूर्णांकात कसे लिहाल?\na) 12.03 मी 		b) 12.003 मी		c) 12.3 मी		d) 12.0003 मी\n\nउकल :  -----------------------------------------------\n','','','','',0,0,0,NULL),(31341,375,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','एक रिक्षा एका तासात 20 किलोमीटर अंतर कापते, तर पाऊण तासात ती किती मीटर अंतर कापेल?\na) 1500 मी		b) 15000 मी		c) 22500 मी		d) 2500 मी\n\nउकल :  -----------------------------------------------','','','','',0,0,0,NULL),(31342,375,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','जर 12 मी अंतरावर प्रत्येकी एक याप्रमाणे 1002 झाडे लावली, तर रस्ता किती लांबीचा होईल?\na) 500 मी		b) 6 किमी		c) 60 मी		d) 12 किमी\n\nउकल :  -----------------------------------------------','','','','',0,0,0,NULL),(31343,375,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','सॅमने केलेल्या एकूण प्रवासा पैकी 25 किमी प्रवास सायकलवर केला, 220 किमी प्रवास आगगाडीने केला आणि 175 किमी प्रवास बस ने केला, तर सायकल आणि बस यांच्या प्रवासापेक्षा रेल्वेने किती अधिक प्रवास केला?\na) 20 किमी		b) 70 किमी		c) 25 किमी		d) 45 किमी\n\nउकल :  -----------------------------------------------','','','','',0,0,0,NULL),(31344,375,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','42000 मिमी लांबीची तार 6 ठिकाणी कापून समान लांबीचे तुकडे केले, तर प्रत्येक तुकड्याची लांबी किती?\na) 700 मिमी		b) 600 मिमी		c) 7 मि		d) 6 मि\n\nउकल :  -----------------------------------------------','','','','',0,0,0,NULL),(31345,375,'mcq','1a',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','30 मीटर लांबीची 