- 2M\n     1) Children play on the ground \n      2) Girls sing a song.\n\nAns. : A] 1) -------------------------------------------------------------\n\n              2) ------------------------------------------------------------\n\n             3) --------------------------------------------------------------\n\nB]        1) --------------------------------------------------------------\n\n           2) --------------------------------------------------------------    ','','','A) 1) lazy, City          2)  a) boy   b) woman         3) a) cat    b) sack\nB) ','',0,0,0,NULL),(36520,387,'descriptive','3',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','A) Do as directed ------------------- 3M\n    1) Write down nouns of opposite gender.\n         i) boy               ii) brother \n2) Write down nouns of opposite gender.\n       i) deer                  ii) dog\n3) Write down nouns of opposite gender.\n      i) husband                   ii) king\nB) Translate the following sentences into Marathi.  -------------- 2M\n     1) Obey your teachers. \n     2) Obey your parents.\n\nAns. : A] 1) -------------------------------------------------------------\n\n              2) ------------------------------------------------------------\n\n             3) --------------------------------------------------------------\n\nB]        1) --------------------------------------------------------------\n\n           2) --------------------------------------------------------------    ','','','A) 1)  girl, sister           2) doe, bitch           3)  wife, Queen\nB) ','',0,0,0,NULL),(36521,387,'descriptive','3',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','A) Do as directed ------------ 3M\n    1) Write down nouns of opposite gender.\n         i) bull                    ii) cock\n2) Write down nouns of opposite gender.\n       i) father                  ii) horse \n3) Write down nouns of opposite gender.\n     i) lion                   ii) man\nB) Translate the following sentences into Marathi.------------ 2M\n    1) Cut your