nce to expand it meaningfully.\n       I know the reason\n\nAns. : ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n        -------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n         --------------------------------------------------------------------\n             \n','','','','',0,0,0,NULL),(36549,393,'descriptive','2a',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Observe the pictures and complete the sentences with proper proposition. --------------------- 5M\n','\na) In : ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n                           \n b) On : ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------                        \n\nc) Under : -----------------------------------------------------------------------------','','a) i) There is a mouse in the hat                      ii) The mouse is in the hat.\nb) i) There is a mouse on the hat                     ii) The mouse is on the hat.\nc) i) There is a mouse under the hat               ii) The mouse is under the hat','',1,0,0,NULL),(36550,393,'descriptive','2b',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Observe the pictures and complete the sentences with proper proposition. --------------------- 5M\n','\na) Near : ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n                           \n b) Infront : ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------                        \n\nc) Behind : -----------------------------------------------------------------------------','','a) i) There is a mouse near the hat               ii) The mouse is near the hat\nb) i) There is a mouse infront of the hat       ii) The mouse is onfront of the hat\nc) i) There is a mouse behind the hat         ii) The mouse is behind the hat','',1,0,0,NULL),(36551,393,'descriptive','2a',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Complete the sentences with ‘over’ or ‘on’ ------------------ 5M\n1) The book is