 i) मोठ्याने वाचणे            ii) दारोदारी\nB] i) गाढवाला गुळाची चव काय?\n    ii) काय भुललासी वरलिया अंगा.','',0,0,0,NULL),(39663,562,'descriptive','2a',5,2,'Out of Text Book','<div style=\"column-count:2;\">It\'s a world of laughter, \nA world of tears. \nIt\'s a world of hopes, \nAnd a world of fears. \nThere\'s so much that we share \nThat it\'s time we\'re aware \nIt\'s a small world after all ...\nIt\'s a small world after all \nIt\'s a small world after all \nIt\'s a small world after all \nIt\'s a small, small world.\nThere is just one moon \nAnd one golden sun \nAnd a smile means \nFriendship to every one. \nThough the mountains divide\nAnd the oceans are wide \nIt\'s a small world after all<div style=\"column-count:2;\">\n','1) Complete the following web :','2) Write the correct word \n    a) The world is ---------              \n    b) The sun is -----------\n      c) The ocean is -------------\n3) Complete the following sentences.\n      Smile means ------------------','','1) i) laughter            ii) tears         iii) hopes           iv) fears\n2) a) small                b) golden           c) wide\n3) Smile means friendship to everyone ','',1,0,0,NULL),(39664,562,'descriptive','3a',5,2,'Out of Text Book','It\'s a world of laughter, \nA world of tears. \nIt\'s a world of hopes, \nAnd a world of fears. \nThere\'s so much that we share \nThat it\'s time we\'re aware \nIt\'s a small world after all ...\nIt\'s a small world after all \nIt\'s a small world after all \nIt\'s a small world after all \nIt\'s a small, small world.\nThere is just one moon \nAnd one golden sun \nAnd a smile means \nFriendship to every one. \nThough the mountains divide\nAnd the oceans are wide \nIt\'s a small world after all\n','1) Complete the following web :','2) Write the correct word \n    a) The world is ---------              \n    b) The sun is -----------\n      c) The ocean is -------------\n3) Complete the following sentences.\n      Smile means ------------------','','