e, cry.\n','\n\n\n\n\n\n\n','','Action : jump, read, walk, smell, go, call, play, cry\nThing/animal/person/place : king, queen, cat, mango, fish, school, cup, shop, office, doctor, peanut, home.\nDescription : fast, red, big, soft, nice, slowly','',1,0,0,NULL),(39964,626,'descriptive','2a',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Answer the following questions :\nWork while you work, \nPlay while you play; \nTo be useful and happy, \nThat is the way.\nAll that you do, \nDo with your might; \nThings done by halves \nAre never done right.\nOne thing at a time, \nAnd that done well, \nIs a very good rule, \nAs many can tell.\nMoments should never \nBe trifled away; \nSo work while you work, \nAnd play while you play.\n\n1) What should you do while you work?\n2) What should you do while you play?\n3) What should you do while you study?\n4) What should you do while you eat?','','','1) work           2) play             3) study             4) eat','',0,0,0,NULL),(39965,626,'descriptive','2b',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Answer the following questions.\n1) When do you sleep?\n2) How long do you sleep?\n3) How long do you study?\n4) When do you swim?\n5) When do you read?\n6) When do you play?','','','1) I sleep at 10 O’clock.\n2) I sleep for eight hours.\n3) I study for 3 hours.\n4) I swim in the summer.\n5) I read in the morning.\n6) I play in the evening.','',0,0,0,NULL),(39966,506,'descriptive','2a',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Answer the following questions :\nWork while you work, \nPlay while you play; \nTo be useful and happy, \nThat is the way.\nAll that you do, \nDo with your might; \nThings done by halves \nAre never done right.\nOne thing at a time, \nAnd that done well, \nIs a very good rule, \nAs many can tell.\nMoments should never \nBe trifled away; \nSo work while you work, \nAnd play while you play.\n\n1) What should you do while you work?\n\n     ----------------------------------------------------------\n2) What should you do while you play?\n\n---------------------------