te the words :\n       i. s_ill           ii. fr_day            iii. mar_h         iv. pe_ple\n2) Arrange the words in alphabetical order :\n        i. scientist, origin, result, pursuit\n       ii. history, forgive, imagine, global\n3) Copy the sentences :\n          i. The little tree was pretty, but it was not happy.\n          ii. “Now I am happy, “ it said.\n4) a) Write any two words begin with ‘s’\n    b) Write any two words begin with ‘m’\n5) Underline the odd words :\n       a) Rose, Mogara, Tiger, Marigold \n       b)  White, Blue, Black, Tree\n6) Write suitable adjectives for the given word ','','','i) Skill        ii) Friday          iii) march         iv) people\n2) i) origin, pursuit, result, scientist\n    ii) forgive, global, history, imagine\n3) i) The little tree was pretty, but it was not happy.\n    ii) “Now I am happy, “ it said.\n4) a) She, said, sorry, safe\n     b) met, man, me, mamma, my\n5) a) Tiger           b) Tree\n6) beautiful, fresh, tiny, white','',1,0,0,NULL),(39981,652,'descriptive','1',10,2,'Out of Text Book','','Complete the words :\n       i. s_op           ii. m_bile         iii. b_cket          iv. sun_ay\n2) Arrange the words in alphabetical order :\n       i. distress, assault, freedom, cultural\n       ii. violently, grief, proposal, astonish\n3) Copy the sentences :\n          i. A rabbit has a short tail.\n          ii. Thieves do not steal glass leaves.\n4) a) Write any two words begin with ‘i’\n     b) Write any two words begin with ‘b’\n5) Underline the odd words :\n    a) Fruits, Flower, Buds, Leaves, Eyes\n    b) Apple, Cabbage, carrot, Spinach\n6) Observe the picture and write the name.','','','i) shop        ii) mobile        iii) bucket         iv) Sunday\n2) i) assault, cultural, distress, freedom\n    ii) astonish, grief, proposal, violently\n3)  i) A rabbit has a short tail.\n     ii) Thieves do not steal glass leaves.\n4) a) In, if, I, it\n     b) big, beautiful, bright, brown\n5) a) eyes            b) apple\n6)