g\n2) chop, clap, read, tap\n3) A little red hen lived on a farm.\n4) clean, new, old, useful\n5) weep, push, hide\n6) i) Fourteen                      ii) thirty   ','',1,0,0,NULL),(40023,655,'descriptive','1a',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Complete the words :\n       i. cust_m           ii. dec_de      \n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------  \n2) Arrange the words in alphabetical order :\n      road, curiosity, dark, important\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n3) Copy the sentences :\n      Her chicks and they all ate up the lovely loaf of bread.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n4) Complete the web of describing words/or write three suitable adjectives for given words','\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n5) Make the list of word : Rivers\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n6) Write the names of pet animals.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------','','i) custom                       ii) decide\n2) curiosity, dark, important, road\n3) Her chicks and they all ate up the lovely loaf of bread.\n4) cloudy, bright, fresh, blue\n5) Ganga, Yamuna, Godavari, Bhima, Koyana, Krushna\n6) horse, dog, cat, bull, cow, buffalo  ','',1,0,0,NULL),(40024,655,'descriptive','1a',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Complete the words :\n       i. dre_s         ii. g_ess   \n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------     \n2) Arrange the words in alphabetical order :\n      important, jeweler, hostile, grateful\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n3) Copy the sentences :\n      This boy has a stomach ache.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n4) Complete the web of describing words/or write three suitable adjectives for given words','\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n5) Write any two words begin with ‘w’\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n6) Make the list of word : Food items \n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n','','i) dress           ii) guess\n2) grateful, hostile, important, jeweler\n3) This boy has a stomach ache.\n4) dirty, hot, cold, clean\n5) Was, walk, when, will, woman, what\n6) roti, chapati, idli, ice-cream, biscuit  ','',1,0,0,NULL),(40025,655,'descriptive','1a',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Complete the words :\n       i. s_ill           ii. fr_day           \n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n2) Arrange the words in alphabetical order :\n     scientist, origin, result, pursuit\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n3) Copy the sentences :\n     The little tree was pretty, but it was not happy.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n4) Write any two words begin with ‘s’\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n5) Underline the odd words :\n     Rose, Mogara, Tiger, Marigold\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n6) Look at the picture and write two action words','\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------','','i) Skill                 ii) Friday\n2) origin, pursuit, result, scientist\n3) The little tree was pretty, but it was not happy.\n4) She, said, sorry, safe\n5) Tiger \n6) ball – kick, throw, catch, bounce ','',1,0,0,NULL),(40026,655,'descriptive','1a',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Complete the words :\n       i. s_op           ii. m_bile         \n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n2) Arrange the words in alphabetical order :\n      dist