ion. (in, to, on)\n\n     ii. My pencil is not ---------- my pocket. (on, from, in)','','',') i) low               ii) short            iii) weak             iv) young\n2) i) cars            ii) by               iii) well            iv) core\n3) i) an              ii) the, the            iii) an, the \n4) i) faces          ii) matches         iii) glasses       iv) watches\n5) i) nice           ii) slow\n6)  i) to         ii) in','',0,0,0,NULL),(40252,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Write an essay on ‘My friend’ with the help of given questions.\n     i. Who is your best friend?\n     ii. How old is she?\n     iii. What are her good qualities?\n     iv. Write about her Favourite things?\n     v. Does he/she help you in your study?\n      vi. Do you like your friend? Why?\n','','','I have many friends but Neha is my best friend. She is 10 years old. We study together in the same class. She is very kind and helpful. Her favourite dish is pav-bhaji. She likes to read story books and playing games. She helps me in my study. We study together. I like my friend very much because she is very polite and always helps me in my difficult times.','',0,0,0,NULL),(40253,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Complete the sentences using ‘before’ or ‘after’\n     i. Sunday comes ------------ Monday.\n     ii. Saturday comes ------------ Friday.\n     iii. Sunday comes ----------- Saturday.\n      iv. Saturday comes ------------- Sunday.','','','i) before             ii) after           iii) after            iv) before','',0,0,0,NULL),(40254,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Read the sentences and use proper pronoun and complete the sentences.\n    i. Neha is a girl. ---------- is very clever. (He/she)\n    ii. This is a cow. ----------- is black. (It/she)\n     iii. I am a girl. --------- name is Asma. (My/Me)\n     iv. This is -------- classroom. (our/us)','','','i) she            ii) it            iii) my             iv) our','',0,0,0,NULL),(40255,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Choose the correct words given in the bracket and complete the essay :\n     [grains, loud, high, national, green, graceful, peahen]\n                                  * The Peacock *\n     The Peacock is our ------------- bird. Its feathers are deep blue and -----------. It has wings but cannot fly ----------. The female bird is called as ----------. The peacock eats ----------- and worms. The peacock is famous for its ---------- dance and -------- cry.\n','','','The Peacock is our national bird. Its feathers are deep blue and green. It has wings but cannot fly high. The female bird is called as peahen. The peacock eats grains and worms. The peacock is famous for its graceful dance and loud cry.','',0,0,0,NULL),(40256,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Choose the correct words given in the bracket and complete the essay :\n     [dead, clean, black, loud]\n                                                     * The crow *\n     The crow is a ----------- bird. Everyone hears its --------- sound caw – caw. The crow eats worms and ------- bodies of animals. It keeps surroundings ----------.\n','','','The crow is a black bird. Everyone hears its loud sound caw – caw. The crow eats worms and dead bodies of animals. It keeps surroundings clean.','',0,0,0,NULL),(40257,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Observe the picture and answer the following questions :\n     Shubham is taking guavas to the market.\n','i. Who takes the guavas?\n     ii. Who is riding a bicycle?\n     iii. Who is taking the guavas to the market?\n     iv. Who is sitting on the branch of the tree?','','i) The monkey takes the guavas            \nii) A girl is riding a bicycle\niii) Shubham is taking the guavas to the market\n iv) The monkey is sitting on the branch of the tree.','',1,0,0,NULL),(40259,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Observe the picture and answer the following questions :\n     Shubham is taking guavas to the market.\n','    i. Who is grazing?\n    ii. What are in the basket?\n    iii. Where is the parrot?\n    iv. What colours are the tree?','','i) The buffalo is grazing          ii) There are guavas in the basket\niii) The parrot is flying in the air.         iv) The trees are green.\n','',1,0,0,NULL),(40260,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Observe the picture and answer the following questions :\n     Champa is selling flowers at the bus stop.\n','  i. Who is selling the flowers?\n  ii. Who is going to school?\n  iii. Who bought the flowers?','','i) The lady is selling the flowers         \nii) The boy is going to school.\n iii) The old woman bought the flowers.','',1,0,0,NULL),(40261,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Observe the picture and answer the following questions :\n     Champa is selling flowers at the bus stop.\n',' i. Where are the people standing?\n  ii. Where are the flowers?\n  iii. What colour are the flowers?\n  iv. How many people are there?','','i) The people are standing on the bus – stop.\nii) The flowers are in the basket.\n iii) The flowers are white.\n  iv) There are five people.','',1,0,0,NULL),(40262,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Observe the picture and answer the following questions :\n     Sonu and Monu are busy watching TV\n','i. Who are watching TV?\nii. Who is sleeping?\niii. who drank the milk?','','i) Sonu and Monu are watching TV.\n ii) The dog is sleeping.\n iii) The cat drank the milk.','',1,0,0,NULL),(40263,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Observe the picture and answer the following questions :\n     Sonu and Monu are busy watching TV\n','i. Where is the cat sitting?\nii. Where is the TV?\niii. How many animals are there?','','i) The cat is sitting to the left of sofa.\nii) The TV is infront of the sofa.\niii) There are two animals.','',1,0,0,NULL),(40264,695,'descriptive','4a',4,2,'Out of Text Book','','Make the meaningful senten