hat feather, I will give you three big diamonds.\" \"Sorry!\" said the Queen.\nThen she met an old woman. The old woman said, \"If you give me that feather, I will give you a necklace of twenty-one pearls\"\n\"Sorry!\" said the Queen.\nThen she met the King. The King said, \"If you give me that feather. I will give you ninety-nine gold coins. \"Sorry!\" said the Queen.\nThen she met the little prince. He said,\n\"Oh, Mamma What a bright beautiful feather!\" \"Take it, my dear,\" said the Queen \"Keep it safe\"\n\nAnswer the following questions :\n1) Who as taking a walk? -------------------------- 1M\n2) Where was the queen taking a walk? ---------------- 1M\n3) Write and complete the table -------------------------- 3M\n    What did the following (persons) people offer the queen?\n     People They offered\n     i) Little man                              ------------------------- \n     ii) ---------------                            a necklace of twenty-one pearls. \n     iii) The king                                    ------------------------- ','','','The queen was taking a walk \n2) The queen was taking a walk in the garden.\n3) i) three big diamond           ii) Old woman            \n    iii) ninety nine gold coins','',0,0,0,NULL),(43776,597,'descriptive','2a',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Read the following sentences and underline the numbers : ------------ 3M\n i) They had two daughters\n ii) January has thirty-one days \niii) There are seven days in a week.\n2) Write the suitable things/objects for given numbers and complete :\n     Sixty  ------------------------- 2M','','','i) two             ii) thity-one           iii) seven\n2) pens, boys, chairs, shirts\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(43777,597,'descriptive','2b',5,2,'Out of Text Book','','Read The passage carefully and answer the following questions \nThe Golden Feather\nOne day, the Queen was taking a walk in her garden, when she found a big, beautiful golden feather.\nThen she met a little man. He said, \"If you g