arter to five\n\n\n\n\n\n\n','','','Answer : ','',0,0,1,NULL),(49223,822,'descriptive','1b',1,2,'Text Book','','Draw the hands of the clock to show the time : 20 minutes past 11\n\n\n\n\n\n\n','','','Answer : ','',0,0,1,NULL),(49224,822,'descriptive','1b',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','Add : 3 hours 25 min + 2 hours 35 min\n\n\n\n\n\n','','','     Hrs            Min\n      3                25\n +   2                35\n----------------------\n        5             60\ni.e.  6 .00 hrs ','',0,0,0,NULL),(49225,822,'descriptive','1b',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','Subtract : 8 hours 20 min – 6 hours 10 min\n\n\n\n\n\n\n','','','     Hrs            Min\n      8                20\n -   6                 10\n----------------------\n        2             10\ni.e.  2 hrs 10 min','',0,0,0,NULL),(49226,822,'descriptive','1b',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','Add : 3 hours 40 min + 2 hours 20 min\n\n\n\n\n\n','','','     Hrs            Min\n      3                40\n +   2                20\n----------------------\n        5             60\ni.e.  6 .00 hrs ','',0,0,0,NULL),(49227,822,'descriptive','1b',1,2,'Out of Text Book','','Subtract : 4 hours 10 min – 2 hours 25 min\n\n\n\n\n\n','','','     Hrs            Min\n       3               60 + 10\n -    2                25\n----------------------\n        1             45\ni.e.  1 hrs 45 min ','',0,0,0,NULL),(49228,822,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Text Book','','The time below is given by the 12-hour clock. Write the same by the 24-clock. : i) 30 minutes past 10 in the morning 		ii) 10 minutes past 8 in the morning\n\nAns. : --------------------------------------------------------------\n\n          -------------------------------------------------------------','','','i) 10 : 30\nii) 8 : 10\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(49229,822,'descriptive','2',2,2,'Text Book','','The time below is given by the 12-hour clock. Write the same by the 24-clock. : i) 20 minutes past 1 in the afternoon		ii) 40 minutes past 5 in the evening\n\nAns. : -----------------------------