oning of clothes\nc) Combustion of petrol in automobiles      d) Melting of an ice cream','','','c) Combustion of petrol in automobiles      \n','',0,0,0,NULL),(66046,320,'mcq','1a',1,0,'Out of Text Book','','Formation of steam from water on boiling is\na) reversible change          b) irreversible change\nc) chemical change            d) undesirable change.','','','a) reversible change\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(66047,320,'mcq','1a',1,0,'Out of Text Book','','The new substances formed during a chemical reaction are called\na) reactants          b) products         c) molecules          d) atoms.','','',' b) products         \n','',0,0,0,NULL),(66048,320,'mcq','1a',1,0,'Out of Text Book','','Properties of a substance before and after a change remained same. What might be the nature of the change?\na) Physical change         b) Chemical change       c) Fast change     d) Periodic change','','','a) Physical change  \n','',0,0,0,NULL),(66049,320,'mcq','1a',1,0,'Out of Text Book','','Which of the following is not a reversible change?\na) Heating of water to steam                b) Cooking of eggs\nc) Heating of wax to molten wax          d) None of these','','','c) Heating of wax to molten wax \n','',0,0,0,NULL),(66050,320,'mcq','1a',1,0,'Out of Text Book','','Which one of the periodic change?\na) Lightening 		b) Storm 		c) Earthquake           	d) Rotation of the earth','','','d) Rotation of the earth\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(66051,320,'mcq','1a',1,0,'Out of Text Book','','In the evaporation process ----- turns into vapour.\na) Liquid 		b) Solid 		c) Gas 		d) all above','','','a) Liquid 	\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(66052,320,'mcq','1a',1,0,'Out of Text Book','','Which of the following is an example of harmful change?\na) Sharpening a pencil  		b) Baking bread 		c) Cooking food 		d) Bursting of fire crackers','','','d) Bursting of fire crackers\n','',0,0,0,NULL),(66053,320,'mcq','1a',1,0,'Out of Text Book','','What kind of change is the conversion of milk into yoghurt?\na) Physical 		b) Chem